    turnFlow: "Turns proceed anticlockwise. On your turn, you must choose one of these actions:\n1. Draw & Discard: Draw 1 card from the stock and discard 1 to the table.\n2. Exchange One: Swap 1 card from your hand with 1 facendup card on the table.\n3. Exchange All: Swap your entire 5ndcard hand for the 5 cards on the table.\n4. Call: If your hand is all one suit, you may 'call' and end the round immediatey.",
